{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=5354030&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-23T12:08:01Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"5354030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "demo", "name": "Worst Class Ever Demo", "steam_appid": 5354030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an asymmetric fun chase game supporting 1-6 online players! 5 players take on the role of naughty students, hiding among dozens of NPC students to secretly pull off pranks like sneaking snacks, passing notes and using phones in class. Meanwhile, 1 player acts as the strict teacher, using sharp observation to hunt down all the mischievous students. Team up with friends to prank and trick each other, and experience the fun strategic battles in the classroom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/b5d6b291971cc049e65005cd62e603a6.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if ordinary campus life turns into a hilarious offensive-defensive battle? You can be a naughty student, sneaking treats like spicy strips and crisps when the teacher isn’t looking. Or step into the shoes of a rigorous teacher, keeping a close watch to spot hidden troublemakers among the crowd. Every round delivers a ridiculous and amusing showdown between teachers and students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/97e0023ae70f83e89e0952761888cf3f.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/88d5abe2067d20440b3f15d3e9dac6a5.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/88d5abe2067d20440b3f15d3e9dac6a5.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/88d5abe2067d20440b3f15d3e9dac6a5.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a class troublemaker, you need to disguise yourself and evade the teacher’s patrols. Seize every chance when the teacher turns away to finish all kinds of funny pranks and create chaotic classroom moments. Balance bold mischief and cautious hiding to enjoy the intense cat-and-mouse tension and satisfying thrills of successful pranks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/e7af25b0adeed7a2d8ff134efcf09789.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/e23bb49195c208252ea738df9aa8ff6b.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/e23bb49195c208252ea738df9aa8ff6b.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/e23bb49195c208252ea738df9aa8ff6b.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You’re the naughtiest class I’ve ever taught!&quot; Play as the strict teacher with a keen eye for details. No subtle tricks, evasive glances or abnormal behaviors of students can escape your notice. Identify all troublemakers accurately, stop classroom pranks and restore order, and relish the rewarding thrill of catching pranksters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/3287c5b6c3f10065fe0323056976d778.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/889e2bc43fbfb87b784e2c4ff78c2e96.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/889e2bc43fbfb87b784e2c4ff78c2e96.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/889e2bc43fbfb87b784e2c4ff78c2e96.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of vivid maps, including bright daily classrooms, dim evening study rooms, fully-equipped computer labs and more. Each classroom features unique hiding spots, exclusive prank tasks and interactive mechanisms. Every map brings fresh hiding strategies and prank gameplay, offering diverse and brand-new match experiences every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/e17dd24453fea550b446384f7519845f.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/7e3c596025ab55273ea891288b4e7064.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/7e3c596025ab55273ea891288b4e7064.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/7e3c596025ab55273ea891288b4e7064.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide array of wacky props greatly enriches the competitive gameplay! Naughty students can use smoke bombs, stun guns, drones and other funny items to set traps, create chaos and distract the teacher, making it much harder to get caught. Teachers can also use professional detective props to locate hidden students, break their disguise and see through all tricks. Flexible prop combinations create countless funny and wonderful moments for nonstop laughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an asymmetric fun chase game supporting 1-6 online players! 5 players take on the role of naughty students, hiding among dozens of NPC students to secretly pull off pranks like sneaking snacks, passing notes and using phones in class. Meanwhile, 1 player acts as the strict teacher, using sharp observation to hunt down all the mischievous students. Team up with friends to prank and trick each other, and experience the fun strategic battles in the classroom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/b5d6b291971cc049e65005cd62e603a6.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.poster.avif?t=1792725924\" width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.webm?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/6e2d74a123ba21561b4d5ed5ed08d70b.mp4?t=1792725924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if ordinary campus life turns into a hilarious offensive-defensive battle? You can be a naughty student, sneaking treats like spicy strips and crisps when the teacher isn’t looking. Or step into the shoes of a rigorous teacher, keeping a close watch to spot hidden troublemakers among the crowd. Every round delivers a ridiculous and amusing showdown between teachers and students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5354030/extras/97e0023ae70f83e89e0952761888cf3f.avif?t=1792725924\" width=794 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_